  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "喝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "哼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "它真的有在變虛弱嗎？這模樣完全看不出來啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "小心岩漿！這傢伙肚子裡到底吞下了多少黑曜石！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨大源石蟲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "————————————————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "雖然有些可憐，但我們也不能手下留情！天火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "好啦，我明白！現在可不是保留實力的時候了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "那麼，這招如何！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨大源石蟲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "————————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "熔岩蟲被激怒了......！我去擋住它們，攻擊就交給你們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "大尾巴！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "總算能從岩漿的縫隙裡瞄準弱點了呐，但是對方這個尺寸，我可不能保證有效喔！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨大源石蟲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——————！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#3",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "成功了！它被趕回之前的方向了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "太好了！這樣一來，市民們就都徹底安全了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "真是的！沒想到解決一隻蟲子會這麼費勁！這下我的裙子也毀了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "畢竟它帶領著一整支族群。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "如果不是有人先破壞了它們的生存環境，也許......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "我累了！不要再提起這種讓人疲憊的話題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "哈哈，我也已經，累得快站不起來了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "但是，我們得回到汐斯塔，還有人在等我們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "倒是能理解你的想法啦，不過站不穩的時候找同伴搭把手，也是成熟的女性應該學會的事情喔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "謝、謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "好了，凱旋而歸總是令人心情愉悅。趕緊回去吧，說不定還能剩下點度假時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "......但是......這裡還是遲早會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "大尾巴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "啊，我這就來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "......天火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "但我們應該尊重這座城市的選擇，剩下的不該由我們插手，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
